\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 <$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>There was a problem; Tony harboured a dark secret. \cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Since the emotional outpouring of 
\f2\i \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 Let Your Momma Go
\f1\i0 , the lyrics he had written during the ensuing days were somewhat finite in number, which is to say, they numbered exactly zero.
